#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:785
msgid "Run this in your terminal. Codex opens your browser to sign in."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute esto en su terminal. Codex abre su navegador para iniciar sesión."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name used in the command
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:787
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Run this in your terminal, then start <code>gemini</code>: it opens your "
"browser to sign in (if it does not, run <code>/mcp auth %s</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Ejecuta esto en tu terminal y luego inicia <code>gemini</code>: abrirá tu "
